      "raw": "[quote=\"MindWanderer\"]\n\nThat&#39;s not what I meant, actually.&nbsp; In Mist Storm he takes over Medico&#39;s body.&nbsp; He&#39;s still limited in that form (it&#39;s super-powerful, but not full-strength Discordian God powerful) and would prefer to be back in his own body, even if it means returning to the Realm of Discord.&nbsp; But in the RPG timeline, Xian Niu, The Master, breaks him out of the OblivAeon shard and he&#39;s just legit free in the world.\n\n[/quote]\n\nWait, wasn&#39;t The Master killed by the &quot;arcane battery&quot; that he leeched from Nightmist, when she reclaimed that power?&nbsp; How would he be alive to break Gloomweaver out of Medico&#39;s shard if he&#39;s dead?\n\n(edit--I stand corrected.&nbsp; The phraseology from the Letters Page was that The Master was &quot;really messed up&quot;, not dead.&nbsp; Yay research!)\n",
